\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Story in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
這稱為我名下的子民，若是自卑、禱告，\textbf{\color{RoyalRed}尋求}我的面，\\
轉離他們的惡行，我必從天上垂聽，赦免他們的罪，醫治他們的地。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
If my people who are called by my name humble themselves, and pray\\
and \textbf{seek} my face and turn from their wicked ways, then I will hear\\
from heaven and will forgive their sin and heal their land.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterBlue} 歷代志下 7:14 \textperiodcentered\ 2 Chronicles 7:14
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 一個問題 \textperiodcentered\ 二十一位王 \textperiodcentered\ 三百八十四年\\
\textit{One question \textperiodcentered\ twenty-one kings \textperiodcentered\ 384 years}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.4cm}p{1.6cm}p{5.4cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{階段} & \textbf{章} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
榮耀 & 1-9 & 所羅門建殿，榮光充滿——全書的高點 \\
分裂與起伏 & 10-28 & 羅波安裂國；亞撒、約沙法的忠心與晚年的失腳；黑暗的中期諸王 \\
復興的高峰 & 29-35 & 希西家、約西亞——兩位極善的改革王，殿門重開，逾越節重守 \\
審判與一扇新門 & 36 & 末代四王速亡，聖殿被焚；古列詔令「可以上去」 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀384年的政治興衰，是來看同一個問題怎樣被問了二十一次：\\
這位王尋求耶和華了嗎？還是離棄了祂？\\
讀到最後一頁，這個問題不再只是問古代的王，也是問你自己。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading 384 years of political history — you are watching\\
one question asked of twenty-one different kings: did he seek the LORD,\\
or abandon him? By the last page, the question is no longer about them.\\
It is about you.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
