{\normalsize\bfseries\color{ChapterBlue} 關於本書 \;\; \footnotesize\scshape About This Book}

\vspace{0.2cm}
\noindent\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\footnotesize\color{TextGray}
本書逐章研讀歷代志下三十六章，整合黃長老查經教導、
John MacArthur 逐節解經、G. Campbell Morgan 屬靈組織分析，
並貫通列王紀、以賽亞書、耶利米書與福音書。
全書以歷代志下 7:14 為總綱：
「這稱為我名下的子民，若是自卑、禱告，尋求我的面，轉離他們的惡行，
我必從天上垂聽，赦免他們的罪，醫治他們的地。」\\[0.4em]
{\itshape
A chapter-by-chapter study of 2 Chronicles, integrating Elder Wong's
teaching, John MacArthur's verse-by-verse exposition, and
G. Campbell Morgan's spiritual analysis — framed by 2 Chronicles 7:14:
if my people seek my face, I will hear from heaven and heal their land.}
\end{minipage}

